{"skill":{"slug":"xiaohongshutools","displayName":"小红书"},"version":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1770095284943,"changelog":"Initial release of the XiaoHongShu (Little Red Book) data collection and interaction toolkit.\n\n- Search and scrape notes/posts by keyword\n- Fetch user profiles, note details, comments, likes, and trending content\n- Support for following users and liking posts\n- Handles all required XiaoHongShu encryption parameters (no browser/JS required)\n- Allows operation in both guest mode and authenticated mode (via web_session cookie)\n- Proxy support for bypassing platform restrictions and rate limits\n- Provides detailed usage instructions, example workflows, and troubleshooting tips","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":8649,"sha256":"e2163304191bc40cd8d4f9253eb3ba2f333951e2a9783b3707a43482c8d6bd1d","contentType":null},{"path":"scripts/units/base_response.py","size":655,"sha256":"b14faf903a7c9d6a686c73a2ca06f2b62bb8fd196d545a0c3347da50d67705f7","contentType":null},{"path":"scripts/units/singleton.py","size":220,"sha256":"4edc154627f76b9704c600de2a2539d66c1f373ad96dd23d05014d558bd151c5","contentType":null},{"path":"scripts/units/fuck_reverse_crypto/asymmetric.py","size":0,"sha256":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855","contentType":null},{"path":"scripts/units/fuck_reverse_crypto/bitwise_operations.py","size":223,"sha256":"1b699122b33547d50f0aa3e0937c15f99717375d5ea3070b7478413ff3b8a2e1","contentType":null},{"path":"scripts/units/fuck_reverse_crypto/encoding.py","size":2826,"sha256":"508de9d7c4821bdce09f2aa99a59af1cd23274dcae054c238bf06514eccb9b51","contentType":null},{"path":"scripts/units/fuck_reverse_crypto/hash_functions.py","size":474,"sha256":"4e70950ab3a094103af48fa09890d5e582ae8ffbb795107391257d9cbdb9578c","contentType":null},{"path":"scripts/units/fuck_reverse_crypto/symmetric.py","size":0,"sha256":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855","conten